/extras/3f894f77cc659a25ecad8a79df808ce9.webm?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/3f894f77cc659a25ecad8a79df808ce9.mp4?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/cb2fcf8df47dd519a0bc5e10352931fc.avif?t=1774287398\" width=978 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items you purchase in the shop are not one-time use; in every battle, you can obtain and use them through &quot;3-Point Line&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/5632a8d3cd99f3ec27d6d1892a563edd.poster.avif?t=1774287398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/5632a8d3cd99f3ec27d6d1892a563edd.webm?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/5632a8d3cd99f3ec27d6d1892a563edd.mp4?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/459e5859e8e6cc53ea5426a327772dcf.avif?t=1774287398\" width=978 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those injured spirits that have defeated enemies for you on the battlefield, although they can no longer continue fighting, still have value (well, perhaps a bit cruel?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4bb3858d751aea180acb58286a0c873b.poster.avif?t=1774287398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4bb3858d751aea180acb58286a0c873b.webm?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4bb3858d751aea180acb58286a0c873b.mp4?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/6589147d3b89cde66289c02b4040b062.avif?t=1774287398\" width=978 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine that every move you make triggers multiple chain reactions, and your spirits become very strong in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/2753e9a88f4bb80c160a5174cbfef699.poster.avif?t=1774287398\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/2753e9a88f4bb80c160a5174cbfef699.webm?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/2753e9a88f4bb80c160a5174cbfef699.mp4?t=1774287398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/25d2bd8f530e83341aa64b5dd123b308.avif?t=1774287398\" width=978 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In e